Variables: are boxes meant to store some value
Statements: They are used to make decisions
Loops:
a) if we have group of something
b) if we have to perform some action over that group

a) while loop

variable;
while(condition)
{
   this will execute only if condition is true
   I/D;
}

b) for loop
for(variable;condition;I/D)
{
   this will execute only if condition is true
}


advanced for loop


